---@field BatchSize? aws.pipes.LimitMax10000 The maximum number of records to include in each batch.
---@field DeadLetterConfig? aws.pipes.DeadLetterConfig Define the target queue to send dead-letter queue events to.
---@field OnPartialBatchItemFailure? aws.pipes.OnPartialBatchItemFailureStreams Define how to handle item process failures. AUTOMATIC_BISECT halves each batch and retry each half until all the records are processed or there is one failed message left in the batch.
---@field MaximumBatchingWindowInSeconds? aws.pipes.MaximumBatchingWindowInSeconds The maximum length of a time to wait for events.
---@field MaximumRecordAgeInSeconds? aws.pipes.MaximumRecordAgeInSeconds Discard records older than the specified age. The default value is -1, which sets the maximum age to infinite. When the value is set to infinite, EventBridge never discards old records.
---@field MaximumRetryAttempts? aws.pipes.MaximumRetryAttemptsESM Discard records after the specified number of retries. The default value is -1, which sets the maximum number of retries to infinite. When MaximumRetryAttempts is infinite, EventBridge retries failed records until the record expires in the event source.
---@field ParallelizationFactor? aws.pipes.LimitMax10 The number of batches to process concurrently from each shard. The default value is 1.
---@field StartingPosition aws.pipes.DynamoDBStreamStartPosition The position in a stream from which to start reading.

